          "content": {
            "size": 7958,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n        <title>freeiptv</title>\n        <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" integrity=\"sha384-QWTKZyjpPEjISv5WaRU9OFeRpok6YctnYmDr5pNlyT2bRjXh0JMhjY6hW+ALEwIH\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n\n        <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n        <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n        <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/iconify-icon@2.3.0/dist/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n        \n        <style>\n            body {\n                font-family: \"Montserrat\", serif;\n                font-optical-sizing: auto;\n                font-weight: 400;\n                font-style: normal;\n                margin-bottom: 4rem;\n            }\n\n            .title {\n                background: #67B90E;\n                background: linear-gradient(to right, #67B90E 0%, #1E80CF 100%);\n                -webkit-background-clip: text;\n                -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n                font-weight: bold !important;\n                font-size: 32px !important;\n                -webkit-user-select: none; /* Safari */\n                -ms-user-select: none; /* IE 10 and IE 11 */\n                user-select: none; /* Standard syntax */\n            }\n\n            .content {\n                text-align: center;\n                margin-top: 3rem;\n                margin-right: 12rem;\n                margin-left: 12rem;\n            }\n\n            @media (max-width: 600px) {\n                .content {\n                    margin-right: 1rem;\n                    margin-left: 1rem;\n                }\n            }\n        </style>\n\n        <script>\n            const copyToClipboard = function(el) {\n                const inputEl = el.parentElement.querySelector(\"input\");\n\n                inputEl.select();\n                inputEl.setSelectionRange(0, 99999); // For mobile devices\n\n                navigator.clipboard.writeText(inputEl.value);\n\n                el.classList.remove(\"btn-outline-secondary\");\n                el.classList.add(\"btn-success\");\n                el.innerHTML = `<iconify-icon icon=\"gg:check-o\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>`;\n                el.setAttribute(\"disabled\", \"true\");\n\n                window.setTimeout(function() {\n                    el.classList.add(\"btn-outline-secondary\");\n                    el.classList.remove(\"btn-success\");\n                    el.innerHTML = `<iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:copy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon>`;\n                    el.removeAttribute(\"disabled\");\n                }, 300);\n            };\n\n            const redirectToLink = function(el) {\n                const inputEl = el.parentElement.querySelector(\"input\");\n\n                window.open(inputEl.value, '_blank').focus();\n            }\n        </script>\n    </head>\n  \n    <body>\n        <nav class=\"navbar bg-body-tertiary\">\n            <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n                <span class=\"navbar-brand mb-0 h1 title\">freeiptv</span>\n            </div>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <h3>IPTV account information</h3>\n\n            <div class=\"alert alert-info mt-4\" role=\"alert\">\n                <h3>PLEASE NOTE</h3>\n                <p>This IPTV account expires after 24 hours of its creation time. <strong>BUT,</strong> you can renew it indefinitely by creating another account once the previous account has expired.</p>\n\n                <h5>This IPTV account doesn't have VOD (movies & series) and is limited to ONLY one device (one concurrent connection).</h5>\n                <h4>If you want access to what the free service offers [30K+ live TV channels] + 900K+ VODs + 3 simultaneous devices for just $5/month, check <iconify-icon icon=\"fluent-emoji:sparkles\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"></iconify-icon> <a href=\"https://argontv.nl\" target=\"_blank\">ArgonTV.nl</a></h4>\n\n                <hr>\n\n                <h3>IMPORTANT: The streams in the below playlist are collected from public sources on the internet. If you want premium quality streams, check ArgonTV.</h3>\n                <br>\n                <h3>FreeIPTV is NOT related to ArgonTV, they are just a sponsor which we recommend using.</h3>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"d-grid gap-2 mt-4\">\n                <a href=\"https://argontv.nl/iptv-installation-guide\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" type=\"button\">View Installation Guide + App Downloads</a>\n                <a href=\"https://argontv.nl/channel-list\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" type=\"button\">View Channel List</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"input-group mb-3 mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"form-floating\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"serverUrl\" value=\"http://freeiptv.ottc.xyz:80\" readonly=\"\">\n                    <label for=\"serverUrl\">IPTV Server URL</label>\n                </div>\n\n                <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"copyToClipboard(this);\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:copy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon></button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"input-group mb-3\">\n                <div class=\"form-floating\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"accUser\" value=\"782431545114\" readonly=\"\">\n                    <label for=\"accUser\">IPTV Username</label>\n                </div>\n\n                <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"copyToClipboard(this);\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:copy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon></button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"input-group mb-3\">\n                <div class=\"form-floating\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"accPass\" value=\"357034783685\" readonly=\"\">\n                    <label for=\"accPass\">IPTV Password</label>\n                </div>\n\n                <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"copyToClipboard(this);\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:copy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon></button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"input-group mb-3\">\n                <div class=\"form-floating\">\n                    <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"m3uLink\" value=\"http://freeiptv.ottc.xyz:80/get.php?username=782431545114&password=357034783685&type=m3u_plus&output=ts\" readonly=\"\">\n                    <label for=\"m3uLink\">M3U Download Link</label>\n                </div>\n\n                <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"redirectToLink(this);\"><iconify-icon icon=\"material-symbols:download\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon></button>\n\n                <button class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"copyToClipboard(this);\"><iconify-icon icon=\"lucide:copy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"></iconify-icon></button>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-floating mb-3\">\n                <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"accAct\" value=\"06-08-2026 10:49:12 pm\" readonly=\"\">\n                <label for=\"accAct\">Activation Time</label>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"form-floating\">\n                <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"accExp\" value=\"07-08-2026 10:49:12 pm\" readonly=\"\">\n                <label for=\"accExp\">Expiration Time</label>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-YvpcrYf0tY3lHB60NNkmXc5s9fDVZLESaAA55NDzOxhy9GkcIdslK1eN7N6jIeHz\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n    </body>\n</html>"
